[Page:Changelog]
SectionType=BulletPoints

[Changelog:20260817]
Fifth release

- Decoded the remaining title-logo glyph bitmaps in bank 3

- Resolved remaining hedged comments via a C-port rebuild cross-check

- Added Stage 2-5 map ref sections and index pages for the banked map data,
  later split into their own ref files along with MapFormat and the
  Common/Title/EndScreen graphics pages

- Added Facts, Bugs, Information and About pages, moved and expanded from the
  skool prologue, with several accuracy fixes along the way

- Added a custom CSS theme for the HTML output

- Fixed multi-paragraph description blocks being misparsed as register/N
  sections

- Reclassified per-frame road-height and horizon-scroll state as g blocks so
  they'll appear in the game status buffer page

[Changelog:20260814]
Fourth release

- Nearly all hedged/TBD comments resolved; the road drawing code is now documented too

- All five 128K banks fully labelled and cross-referenced

- Stage, title and end-screen graphics given their own index pages

- $E300-$EDFF memory map rewritten to match the C port's state layout

- Added a scaffold disassembly for the Megatape 23 demo build

- Added a road map text format and compiler for editing stage data by hand

[Changelog:20231102]
Third release

- Virtually everything is now labelled

- Most locations are mapped out

- Most of the graphics are decoded

- The map data format is mostly understood

- Many of the routines are reasonably documented

- Some still are not, notably the road drawing code

[Changelog:20230518]
Second release

- Lots of graphics decoded

- Map data is understood better

- Many functions have semi decent explanations

[Changelog:20230426]
First release

